Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:04.80,Artist,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,650)}MERCY IN MINOR
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:04.80,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,650)}Join Me in Life
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.55,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,110)}You say you're just\Na weight we carry
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.06,0:00:09.50,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,110)}That we'd be lighter\Nwith you gone
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.80,0:00:13.60,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,110)}That's the night talking,\Nit isn't you
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.38,0:00:17.75,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,110)}And it's had your voice\Ntoo long
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.88,0:00:22.00,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,110)}But who would sing\Nthe wrong words with me
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.10,0:00:26.12,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,110)}To every stupid summer song
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.38,0:00:30.10,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,110)}I know how it pulls you,\Nit pulled at me too
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.28,0:00:33.72,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,110)}Some days it still\Ntakes the light
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.98,0:00:38.30,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,110)}But I'll sit with you there\Nin the waiting room
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.38,0:00:41.90,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,110)}Till they call your name\Ntonight
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.28,0:00:44.65,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,110)}Baby, join me in life
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.66,0:00:50.12,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,110)}Just tonight,\Njust tonight
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.12,0:00:54.80,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,110)}Give me one more\Nwinter morning
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.00,0:00:58.80,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,110)}Stay with me\Nuntil it's light
